[
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Oh! I didn't see you there—hello!",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "I'm Shikkor—used to be an explorer, and I guess I still am, even in this weird world. Definitely not what I was expecting.",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "But this place has monsters wandering around, which is... less than ideal. ",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "You seem tougher than me. Think you could help me keep exploring without getting mauled?",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "I did, once... Now... I'll try.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 6,
    "DialogueContent": "Great! So, what do I need to do?",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 7,
    "DialogueContent": "Relax.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Hmm, this place feels safe. So it's... inside you?",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "I suppose so.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "Oh! That coffin—look, I can see the outside world through it! Fascinating. I can keep an eye on everything from here.",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "In return, how about I help you map it all? Bet I've got a sharper sense of direction than you do.",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "Alright.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 6,
    "DialogueContent": "Perfect! Glad I can pitch in. Say... what was your name again?",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 7,
    "DialogueContent": "...Grim.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 8,
    "DialogueContent": "Got it, Grim. I won't hold you up any longer. Happy exploring!",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 2,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Remember to take a break every now and then.",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "You! You're the one who stuffed me into that coffin by keeping silent!",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "Hurry up—take me back already! I'm not wasting another minute out here.",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "Since I got out of that coffin, I haven't had a single day of peace—it's been run, run, run!",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "But...",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "No excuses! Stand aside and collect me now!",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 6,
    "DialogueContent": "...Alright.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Huh, not bad. Looks like you've upgraded your coffin—it wasn't this wide or flat before.",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "This isn't the same as before.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "Really? Then what happened? Why're we out of it in the first place? Isn't that your job?",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "I... I don't know.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "Great. Well, if you can't handle it, I can help whip you into shape. I'm an athlete, after all—I'll at least get you moving faster.",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 6,
    "DialogueContent": "...Alright.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 7,
    "DialogueContent": "Good. Now I'm gonna rest up—I'll need my energy for training later.",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 2,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "What are you staring at? Haven't you seen exercise before?",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Faster, faster, faster!",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "Hello?",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "Oh—hello, hello! I've been dying for an audience.",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "Care to watch my juggling? I guarantee you'll be laughing in no time!",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "Uh... sure?",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 6,
    "DialogueContent": "Perfect! Feast your eyes on my best routine yet!",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 7,
    "DialogueContent": "...",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 8,
    "DialogueContent": "You know, it's okay to laugh...",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 9,
    "DialogueContent": "Did I mess up? You're the only audience I've found...",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 10,
    "DialogueContent": "...",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 11,
    "DialogueContent": "Relax. I'll take you someplace with more people.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "At least you've more audience here.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "Indeed! A clown is nothing without an audience. ",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "You've given me this stage, so I'll give you the best show a clown can offer.",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "... I have work to do...",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "Oh, it's easy—let me teach you to juggle your scythe! Then you can bring back even more fans!",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 6,
    "DialogueContent": "I really need to go...",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 7,
    "DialogueContent": "Don't forget to bring back more audience!",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 2,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Miss my show?",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "You're back. How's your head? Any pain or strange feelings?",
    "SpeakerID": 4,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "I'm still weak.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "I want to get stronger.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "Expected as much. I sorted the herbs(<sprite index=4>)I've found while you were away. There's one that can strengthen you, though it won't restore you to full power.",
    "SpeakerID": 4,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "I used the last of my supply to brew this potion for you. Drink up—but after this, you'll have to collect more on your own.",
    "SpeakerID": 4,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 6,
    "DialogueContent": "Bring me three of those herbs(<sprite index=4>), and I'll make you another batch.",
    "SpeakerID": 4,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 2,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Did you find three more (<sprite index=4>)?",
    "SpeakerID": 4,
    "Column5": ""
  }
]